WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:02.920
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:08.750
Today I am going to explain a French horror
drama film called “They Came Back.”

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.260
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:16.410
Watch out and take care!

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:21.890
The movie begins in an anonymous French town
where one day, a crowd of revived dead people

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:24.689
walk out of the cemetery, unexplained.

00:00:24.689 --> 00:00:30.650
They calmly stream down the road in a silent
procession while the bystanders watch in astonishment.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:34.440
As the crowd gets larger, the town council
holds a meeting to discuss the matter.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:37.240
They, too, are as perplexed as the common
people.

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:41.429
The mayor reveals that the entire world is
facing the same situation at the moment and

00:00:41.429 --> 00:00:44.739
no one knows what is causing the dead to come
back to life.

00:00:44.739 --> 00:00:49.910
Initial estimates that more than seventy million
men and women have revived all over the world

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:52.120
and the counting is still going on.

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:56.719
In their town alone, almost thirteen thousand
people have come back to life.

00:00:56.719 --> 00:01:01.030
The flow of the dead coming out of the cemetery
lasted for about two hours.

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:06.460
Apparently, the returnees include men and
women who have died in the past ten years.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:10.250
After referring to the death registers, it
is found that the crowd consists of people

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:15.280
of all ages but more than sixty-five percent
of them are over the age of sixty.

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:20.159
One thing remains the same in all the revived
individuals; they are all in good health,

00:01:20.159 --> 00:01:22.340
unlike their conditions before their deaths.

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:26.680
To keep these people off the streets and provide
them with shelter, the mayor requisitions

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:29.670
the local community center and warehouses.

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:34.490
He says that it is vital to keep all the returnees
together to identify them and send them back

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:39.130
to their families because they are now the
citizens of the nation and deserve rights.

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:43.500
The committee together estimates that they
have to keep the returnees in such facilities

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.610
for three to six months and dismisses the
meeting.

00:01:46.610 --> 00:01:51.130
Soon, the dormitories start being prepared
where the individuals will be accommodated

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:53.280
according to their gender and age.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:57.530
Among the revived individuals is the mayor’s
wife Martha.

00:01:57.530 --> 00:02:01.830
Someone brings her to the mayor but he refuses
to see her and sends her home.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:07.299
A member of the town council is named Isham
who had lost his 6-year-old boy, Sylvain some

00:02:07.299 --> 00:02:08.500
years ago.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:12.910
He and his wife Véronique go to one of the
dorms looking for the kid.

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:17.410
On their way, they see many “returned”
people who are being tested and interviewed.

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:22.160
The returnees seem to be void of emotions
as they stare into the distance and do not

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:26.200
indulge in conversation until they are approached
by someone first.

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:30.190
The couple shows Sylvain’s pictures to the
officials who ask them to wait.

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:34.180
They are also told that they can either take
the kid home or leave him in the dorm if they

00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:35.260
aren’t ready.

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:38.940
When the kid arrives in front of his parents,
they are beyond shocked.

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:43.940
The scene shifts to the mayor’s home where
he meets his deceased wife for the first time.

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:47.680
She acts like she has never been gone, and
asks him why he is late.

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:52.520
Meanwhile, Isham’s coworker Rachel is in
her home overwhelmed by everything that is

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:53.590
going on.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:58.630
Her husband Mathieu died in a car crash two
years ago but she has already accepted his

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:02.340
death, so she isn’t sure if she should welcome
him back to her life.

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:07.010
The following day at work, Isham tells her
that his son is exactly like how he was prior

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:10.150
to his death, he acts like nothing has changed.

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:14.550
He also asks Rachel if she plans to bring
Mathieu home but Rachel just dismisses the

00:03:14.550 --> 00:03:15.660
conversation.

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:19.070
The town council holds a meeting again after
a few days.

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:23.830
They are now concerned about the potential
unemployment and housing problem in the future.

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:28.270
Moreover, the returnees are slow and they
cannot communicate well which means they are

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:31.280
not as efficient as they were in their previous
jobs.

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:35.590
The council also addresses that the revived
people suffer from effects similar to those

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:40.940
that may be seen after a severe concussion,
such as disorientation, sleep disturbance,

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:42.450
and wandering.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:45.860
But for some strange reason, their motor functions
are unharmed.

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:49.980
Then, we are shown Mathieu who has returned
to his job as an architect.

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:54.870
However, he is sluggish in his job and only
speaks when people talk to him first.

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:57.200
Rachel has still not tried to find him.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:01.880
Soon, another problem for the council arises
when the returned start to walk out to the

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:03.620
woods at night.

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:07.750
Researchers believe that they might be trying
to look for a familiar place or it could just

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:11.060
be a response to the traumatic experience
of dying.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:16.470
To solve this problem, a doctor named Gardet
develops a sedative that only works on the

00:04:16.470 --> 00:04:17.470
returned.

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:21.239
He also trains the security guard at the dorm
on how to stop them from wandering off to

00:04:21.239 --> 00:04:22.380
the woods.

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:26.659
While observing the sleeping revived people,
he notices Mathieu dressing up and walking

00:04:26.659 --> 00:04:27.659
out.

00:04:27.659 --> 00:04:31.539
The security guard claims that he does this
every night and goes to his work.

00:04:31.539 --> 00:04:35.319
The doctor finds this strange and follows
Matieu to his work.

00:04:35.319 --> 00:04:39.099
There, he sees a group of returned people
having a meeting.

00:04:39.099 --> 00:04:41.919
According to the watchman, they do this every
day.

00:04:41.919 --> 00:04:46.719
One day, Rachel is returning home from work
when she notices Mathieu following her behind.

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:50.259
The two do not talk and simply make their
way home.

00:04:50.259 --> 00:04:54.129
Doctor Gardet, who has been observing Mathieu’s
behavior, follows them.

00:04:54.129 --> 00:04:58.599
Rachel is still not comfortable being around
her husband so she goes to her room claiming

00:04:58.599 --> 00:05:00.310
that she has to rest.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:05.120
At the mayor’s home, he organizes a party
to reintroduce Martha to the family members.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:10.360
However, in between the dinner, she stops
talking and walks away towards the woods.

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:14.389
Her caretaker says that she has been walking
around the yard the entire day.

00:05:14.389 --> 00:05:18.800
The mayor follows his wife and tries to bring
her back to the table but she continues walking

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:20.610
without any explanation.

00:05:20.610 --> 00:05:25.460
Meanwhile, at night, Rachel approaches Mathieu
and starts a conversation.

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:32.300
She eventually kisses him and the two end
up having intercourse in the living room,

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:37.310
while the doctor spies on them through the
window.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:41.310
In the next council meeting, a lady brings
up the fact that the revived people have body

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:44.069
temperature lower than a normal person.

00:05:44.069 --> 00:05:47.999
Because of this, they are picked up by thermal
cameras as whitish figures.

00:05:47.999 --> 00:05:53.419
So, the council decides to observe their activities
through the cameras attached to hot air balloons

00:05:53.419 --> 00:05:55.189
spread throughout the town.

00:05:55.189 --> 00:05:59.550
Their main aim is to find out more about the
nightly meeting that the returnees often hold

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:01.230
in different parts of the town.

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:05.099
When the first set of reports arrives, a surprising
element is found.

00:06:05.099 --> 00:06:10.090
All the returnees, whether they be young or
old, cover a distance of at least nine miles

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:11.169
every day.

00:06:11.169 --> 00:06:15.539
They end the meeting by stating when more
data is recovered they can point out the similarities

00:06:15.539 --> 00:06:18.529
and frequencies of the returnee gatherings.

00:06:18.529 --> 00:06:21.779
One day, Rachel and Mathieu are sunbathing
beside a lake.

00:06:21.779 --> 00:06:26.639
Rachel, who was skeptical about Mathieu’s
return, is now comfortable around him.

00:06:26.639 --> 00:06:30.849
The returnees in the lake can be easily identified
by their stiffness.

00:06:30.849 --> 00:06:32.770
The couple meets doctor Gardet there.

00:06:32.770 --> 00:06:37.090
He explains Mathieu’s behavior to Rachel
and tells her he is recovering quickly from

00:06:37.090 --> 00:06:38.090
the trauma.

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:42.939
At night, Rachel hears a noise and comes to
her backyard only to find that the doctor

00:06:42.939 --> 00:06:44.560
has followed them home.

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:48.749
On questioning, he says that he wants to help
her cope with the situation, claiming that

00:06:48.749 --> 00:06:50.480
he knows how she feels.

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:54.629
He inquires if she knows that Mathieu wakes
up at night to go to his work.

00:06:54.629 --> 00:06:59.389
Rachel says he just has trouble falling asleep
and insists her husband is normal.

00:06:59.389 --> 00:07:04.099
After making him go away, she returns to the
bedroom and finds Mathieu awake.

00:07:04.099 --> 00:07:08.379
He asks her if she was talking to someone
but she lies and says she wasn’t.

00:07:08.379 --> 00:07:12.840
The next day at work, Mathieu submits his
work to his boss but his reports make little

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:14.180
to no sense.

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:17.979
Even when the boss explains his errors, Mathieu
doesn’t understand.

00:07:17.979 --> 00:07:22.460
Hence, he is demoted to the technical part
of the company where other returnees like

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:24.069
him work.

00:07:24.069 --> 00:07:28.120
In the following town council meeting, the
officials declare that the semi-normal behavior

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:30.259
that the returnees show is an illusion.

00:07:30.259 --> 00:07:34.749
They have been imitating the expressions of
the living and following the memories of what

00:07:34.749 --> 00:07:38.949
they used to do before their deaths to create
an illusion of being normal.

00:07:38.949 --> 00:07:42.210
But they are not capable of innovative jobs
at all.

00:07:42.210 --> 00:07:46.620
At night, Mathieu gets dressed without Rachel
knowing and goes to his work.

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:50.949
This time, the doctor overhears what the returnees
talk about in their meetings.

00:07:50.949 --> 00:07:55.330
They seem to be talking normally about city
maps and areas around the town.

00:07:55.330 --> 00:08:00.499
Meanwhile, the kid Sylvain wakes up in the
middle of the night and bangs on his front

00:08:00.499 --> 00:08:02.190
door, wanting to get out.

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:03.969
His parents are worried about him.

00:08:03.969 --> 00:08:08.009
The school has also informed them to take
Sylvain somewhere else because he scares the

00:08:08.009 --> 00:08:09.199
other kids.

00:08:09.199 --> 00:08:13.289
His mother cries saying that all he wants
to do is run away from them.

00:08:13.289 --> 00:08:18.599
Similarly, the mayor’s wife also tries escaping
by jumping off a fence but the mayor stops

00:08:18.599 --> 00:08:19.599
her.

00:08:19.599 --> 00:08:21.939
The following day he talks to Rachel about
his wife.

00:08:21.939 --> 00:08:26.259
He is worried that one day he will wake up
at night and she will be gone but Rachel claims

00:08:26.259 --> 00:08:27.479
that it is their fate.

00:08:27.479 --> 00:08:32.310
It is clear that all the returnees are trying
to escape from their homes and gather together

00:08:32.310 --> 00:08:36.360
but no one can decipher what they are talking
about in their nightly meetings.

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:41.680
Rachel goes to doctor Gardet that day to ask
him how she can help Mathieu get back to normal.

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:46.100
But the doctor says that she can never bring
him back to how he was before he died.

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:49.820
The most he can do is remember everything
that happened before his death.

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:54.310
The doctor also shows her a clip of Mathieu
saying that he met Rachel two weeks ago when

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:56.930
he had been dead for two years before that.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:09:02.980
Rachel loses all hopes of getting her husband
back and returns home only to find him missing.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:07.910
Somewhere else, a security guard finds Mathieu
and other returnees in a field and asks them

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:09.420
to go away.

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:13.020
Just then, a loud explosion is heard from
nearby.

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:17.470
Following that, the returnees detonate several
explosions throughout the city.

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:20.820
All of them come to the street and make their
way to a tunnel.

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:24.940
The mayor wakes up to his wife missing and
drives around looking for her.

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:29.090
He eventually finds her in the streets and
forcefully gets her into the car.

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:33.040
However, the other returnees block him from
driving away.

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:35.410
Martha asks the mayor if he is tired.

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:38.670
When he doesn’t reply she inquires if he
wants to join them.

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:41.460
She has sensed that he is on the brink of
death.

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:45.850
As she calmly talks to him, he passes away
and joins the returnees.

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:50.260
Meanwhile, at Isham’s home, Sylvain is still
trying to escape.

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:54.860
His mother wants to let go of him but Isham
insists he will keep the kid forever.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:59.080
As they talk, Sylvain falls off the balcony
from the second floor.

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:03.550
He stands up and joins a returnee man who
had been waiting for him.

00:10:03.550 --> 00:10:08.120
In retaliation to the explosions, the military
responds by gassing the returnees with a chemical

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.590
that induces a permanent coma.

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:14.540
After guiding some of the revived people to
the tunnels, Mathieu makes his way back to

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:16.030
a worried Rachel.

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:19.800
He tells her everything that happened on the
day of his fatal car accident.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:24.040
He remembers that they had a fight and he
took off in his car angrily.

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:28.750
When he returned home, Rachel was missing
so he went looking for her.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:33.040
Knowing that Mathieu was looking for her when
the accident happened, Rachel cries.

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:37.670
She follows him into the tunnels, tearfully
kissing him goodbye before he disappears into

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:38.900
the darkness.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:43.580
In the morning, the military carts away the
comatose bodies of the returnees.

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:49.890
In the last scene, the bodies are laid atop
their graves in the cemetery and slowly vanish.

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:54.170
